{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>方力申（小方）去年12月成為新手爸爸，女兒愛嘉（Isla）目前約11個月大，小方不時在社交平台分享B女日常，今早（15日）小方在Ig分享囡囡連續贈飛吻的片段，片中快將1歲的Isla扶實牀沿，然後不停輕擺身體，接着拍片的小方叫囡囡給Flying kiss，Isla亦乖巧做出飛吻動作，當小方叫「爸爸」時，Isla也搞笑跟着叫爸爸，十分可愛，而Isla已長出牙仔，笑起上來也特別甜。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T05:35:47.481736+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":189,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T04:29:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T08:28:23.427655+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T05:29:43.100312+00:00","content_hash":"294a7146e8abdb99f29249db60f0b3806a8c8dcd87f894d21ce64a04f36ef87e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-15T05:35:47.481736+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}